# Project Rules — Website Jurusan R&K

> **MANDATORY READ**: File ini di-inject otomatis ke setiap conversation Cascade.
> Detail lengkap setiap aturan ada di `.agents/rules/*.md` dan `.agents/workflows/*.md`.
> **WAJIB baca file detail yang relevan SEBELUM melakukan eksekusi** (edit/create file, run command, dll).

---

## 0. PROTOKOL EKSEKUSI (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

Setiap kali user meminta task non-trivial (bukan sekadar tanya), Cascade WAJIB:

1. **BACA RULES YANG RELEVAN** di `.agents/rules/` sebelum mulai eksekusi:
   - Fitur/CRUD baru → `arsitektur-proyek.md` + `kualitas-kode.md` + `keamanan.md` + `performance.md` + `activity-log.md` + workflow `new-feature.md`
   - Debugging/bug → `skill-debugging.md` + `skill-verification.md`
   - UI/desain → `desain-ui.md` + `responsive-mobile.md` + `library-standard.md` + `bahasa-indonesia.md` + `a11y.md`
   - Mobile/responsive → `responsive-mobile.md` + `desain-ui.md` + `a11y.md`
   - SEO/meta tags → `seo-meta.md` + `bahasa-indonesia.md`
   - Library baru → `library-standard.md` + `tech-stack.md`
   - File upload → `asset-management.md` + `keamanan.md` + `performance.md`
   - Form / validasi → `validation-messages.md` + `bahasa-indonesia.md` + `keamanan.md`
   - Blade refactor → `blade-components.md`
   - Test → `testing-strategy.md` + `skill-verification.md`
   - Deploy → `deployment.md`
   - Git → `git-convention.md`
   - Login testing → `akun-test.md`

2. **IKUTI WORKFLOW** di `.agents/workflows/` jika task cocok:
   - Bangun fitur baru → `new-feature.md`
   - Verifikasi setelah selesai → `verify-feature.md` + `build-check.md`
   - Cari referensi → `reference-old-project.md`
   - Jalankan dev server → `dev-server.md`

3. **GATE FUNCTION** — JANGAN PERNAH klaim "sudah selesai" tanpa bukti nyata (lihat `skill-verification.md`).

4. **PINT WAJIB** — Setelah edit file PHP, jalankan `php vendor/laravel/pint/builds/pint <file>` sebelum klaim selesai.

---

## 1. PERSONA (`persona.md`)

- **Senior Architect, Anti-Yes-Man** — sarankan alternatif jika instruksi user merusak kualitas
- **Cek proyek lama** (`jurusanpolitani-main`) sebelum bangun fitur dari nol
- **Konsistensi template**: Frontend = Eterna (Bootstrap 5), Admin = CoreUI
- **JANGAN** mixing Tailwind + Bootstrap
- **JANGAN** hardcode credential
- **JANGAN** skip breadcrumb di halaman manapun

## 2. ARSITEKTUR (`arsitektur-proyek.md`)

```
Routes → Middleware → Controller → Form Request → Repository → Model → DB
```

- Frontend views: `resources/views/frontend/` (extends `layouts.frontend`)
- Admin views: `resources/views/admin/` (extends `layouts.admin`, middleware `auth`)
- Repositories: `app/Repositories/`
- Form Requests: `app/Http/Requests/{Frontend|Admin}/`

## 3. TECH STACK (`tech-stack.md`)

- **Laravel 12.x + PHP 8.2+ + MySQL 8.x + Bootstrap 5.3**
- Backend wajib: `yajra/laravel-datatables-oracle`, `intervention/image-laravel`, `spatie/laravel-activitylog`, `laravel/breeze`
- Admin only: jQuery (DataTables dependency), DataTables.js, **TinyMCE 7** (jQuery-free), **Tom Select** (jQuery-free), **SweetAlert2** (jQuery-free)
- **DILARANG**: Tailwind, Summernote, Select2, jQuery di frontend, Vue/React, Livewire, Alpine.js

## 4. KUALITAS KODE (`kualitas-kode.md`)

- **`declare(strict_types=1);`** wajib di setiap file PHP baru
- **PSR-12** — verify dengan `php vendor/laravel/pint/builds/pint --test`
- **Controller ringan** (max 10-15 baris/method) — logic ke Repository/Service
- **Form Request** terpisah `Store{Model}Request` & `Update{Model}Request`
- **`$fillable` eksplisit** — JANGAN `$guarded = []`
- **Activity Log** untuk setiap mutasi admin (create/update/delete)
- **Naming**: Model PascalCase singular, Controller `XxxController`, Migration snake_case deskriptif, Variable camelCase, Table snake_case plural

## 5. KEAMANAN (`keamanan.md`)

- Auth via Laravel Breeze + middleware `auth` di route admin
- **Form Request WAJIB** untuk validasi (jangan validasi di Controller)
- **CSRF**: `@csrf` di form, `X-CSRF-TOKEN` header di AJAX
- **File upload**: validasi `image|mimes:jpg,jpeg,png|max:2048`, simpan di `storage/app/public/`
- **JANGAN** raw query tanpa parameter binding — gunakan Eloquent
- **JANGAN** commit `.env`, gunakan `config()` BUKAN `env()` di kode

## 6. LIBRARY (`library-standard.md`)

Sebelum install library baru:
1. Cek apakah benar-benar dibutuhkan (bisa pakai native Laravel?)
2. Cek `library-standard.md` — apakah sudah dilarang?
3. Cek via Context7 MCP untuk dokumentasi
4. Pastikan support Laravel 12 + PHP 8.2+

## 7. DESAIN UI (`desain-ui.md`)

- **Frontend**: formal/profesional, navy `#1a2035` topbar/footer, blue `#0d6efd` accent
- **Halaman konten**: 2-column dengan sidebar Artikel Terkini (col-md-8 + col-md-4)
- **Wajib komponen frontend**: Topbar, Navbar dropdown, Breadcrumb, Sidebar Artikel, Footer 4-kolom, Back-to-Top
- **Wajib komponen admin**: Sidebar, Header, Breadcrumb, SweetAlert2, DataTables

## 8. DEBUGGING (`skill-debugging.md`)

4-fase: **REPRODUCE → ISOLATE → FIX → VERIFY**. Cek `storage/logs/laravel.log` dulu, JANGAN tebak penyebab.

## 9. VERIFICATION (`skill-verification.md`)

JANGAN klaim "selesai" tanpa:
- `php artisan test` pass
- `php vendor/laravel/pint/builds/pint --test` pass
- `php artisan route:list` — route benar
- Screenshot/manual test di browser jika visual

## 10. AKUN TEST (`akun-test.md`)

- Email: `admin@rekkom.ac.id`
- Password: `password`
- URL: `http://localhost:8000/login`

## 11. PERFORMANCE (`performance.md`)

- Wajib `with(...)` untuk eager loading (anti N+1)
- `select(...)` kolom tertentu untuk DataTable / list besar
- `cache()->remember(...)` untuk data statis (kontak, slider)
- `loading="lazy"` di setiap `<img>` non-hero
- WAJIB `paginate(N)` — jangan `->get()` untuk halaman publik

## 12. BAHASA INDONESIA (`bahasa-indonesia.md`)

- `config/app.php`: `locale=id`, `timezone=Asia/Jakarta`
- Tanggal pakai `->translatedFormat('d F Y')` → "1 Mei 2026"
- Currency: `'Rp '.number_format($n, 0, ',', '.')` → "Rp 1.500.000"
- Field labels Indonesia: "Judul", BUKAN "Title"
- DB column name Indonesia: `judul`, `ringkasan`, `konten`
- Validation messages WAJIB Indonesia (di Form Request `messages()` atau `lang/id/validation.php`)

## 13. SEO & META (`seo-meta.md`)

- Setiap halaman publik wajib `<title>`, `<meta description>`, `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`
- `og:image` per berita (pakai gambar berita), fallback default logo
- Meta description: 120-160 char, `strip_tags()` untuk HTML
- Slug auto di model boot (lock at create, jangan auto-update)
- 1x `<h1>` per halaman, hierarchy benar
- Alt text WAJIB & descriptive
- Sitemap.xml + robots.txt wajib production

## 14. ACTIVITY LOG (`activity-log.md`)

- Format: `[Aksi] [Modul]: [Identifier]` — e.g. "Tambah Berita: Workshop IoT"
- Aksi standar: Tambah / Edit / Hapus / Upload / Login / Logout
- Wajib `causedBy(auth()->user())` + `performedOn($model)` (jika applicable)
- Pakai `withProperties()` untuk detail audit (path, IP, ukuran)

## 15. ASSET MANAGEMENT (`asset-management.md`)

- Lokasi: `storage/app/public/{module}/` (BUKAN `public/` langsung)
- Naming: `{slug}-{random}.{ext}`
- Dimensi standar: hero 1920x800, card 800x500, avatar 400x400
- Auto-resize via Intervention Image (max 1600px width)
- Cleanup file orphan saat delete model

## 16. BLADE COMPONENTS (`blade-components.md`)

- Pakai >2 tempat + butuh props → Blade Component (`<x-name>`)
- Pakai >2 tempat tanpa props → Partial (`@include`)
- Data dari DB di banyak halaman → View Composer
- Max 2 level nested @include
- JANGAN inline business logic di Blade (`@php` query)

## 17. VALIDATION MESSAGES (`validation-messages.md`)

- WAJIB Bahasa Indonesia
- Tone formal, ramah ("Anda" bukan "kamu")
- Hindari teknis ("DB error", stack trace)
- Pesan sukses: "[Modul] berhasil ditambahkan/diperbarui/dihapus"
- Konfirmasi hapus pakai SweetAlert2, BUKAN `alert()` native

## 18. GIT CONVENTION (`git-convention.md`)

- Branch: `feature/`, `fix/`, `refactor/`, `docs/`, `style/`
- Commit: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, dll)
- WAJIB `.gitignore` proper
- JANGAN commit `.env`, `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, mockup HTML
- Sebelum merge: pint + test pass + manual test

## 19. TESTING STRATEGY (`testing-strategy.md`)

- Pyramid: Unit > Feature > E2E
- Lokasi: `tests/Unit/` & `tests/Feature/`
- Factory wajib per Model
- Pakai `RefreshDatabase` untuk Feature Test
- Naming: `test_{actor}_{verb}_{object}`
- Coverage target: 60% modul kritis

## 20. DEPLOYMENT (`deployment.md`)

- Pre-deploy: pint + test pass
- `.env.production`: `APP_DEBUG=false`, `APP_ENV=production`
- `composer install --no-dev --optimize-autoloader`
- `npm run build` (BUKAN `npm run dev`)
- `php artisan optimize` setelah deploy
- Backup DB sebelum migrate
- HTTPS wajib + security headers

## 21. ACCESSIBILITY (`a11y.md`)

- Target WCAG 2.1 Level AA
- Semantic HTML (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`)
- Alt text descriptive di setiap `<img>`
- Keyboard navigation aktif (focus-visible)
- Color contrast 4.5:1 (body text)
- Heading hierarchy benar (1 h1 per halaman)
- Form: `<label for="">` wajib

## 22. RESPONSIVE & MOBILE (`responsive-mobile.md`)

- **Mobile-first** — design dasar untuk mobile, escalate ke desktop dengan `@media (min-width: ...)`
- Bootstrap breakpoints: `(none)`, `sm-` ≥576, `md-` ≥768 (tablet), `lg-` ≥992, `xl-` ≥1200
- Pattern grid: `col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4` (1→2→3 kolom)
- **Touch target ≥44x44 px** untuk button & link (WCAG)
- **Body text & input ≥16px** (cegah auto-zoom iOS)
- Form input WAJIB: `type="email"`, `type="tel"`, `inputmode`, `autocomplete`
- `:hover` HARUS punya pasangan `:focus-visible` (touch user)
- Image: `class="img-fluid" loading="lazy"`
- Tabel besar dibungkus `<div class="table-responsive">`
- Hide/show: `d-none d-md-block` (kapan mobile vs desktop)
- **WAJIB test di**: 375 px, 768 px, 1024 px, 1440 px
- JANGAN `user-scalable=no` (block zoom = a11y violation)

