## QUICK COMMANDS

```powershell
# Pint format (Windows path issue: pakai php langsung, BUKAN ./vendor/bin/pint)
php vendor/laravel/pint/builds/pint <file>
php vendor/laravel/pint/builds/pint --test  # check only

# Test
php artisan test

# Cache clear (CSS/Blade tidak butuh ini, tapi route/config butuh)
php artisan view:clear
php artisan route:clear
php artisan config:clear

# Dev server
php artisan serve  # port 8000
```

